WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.899
This is Eco Town. Florence the robot is planning it.

2
00:00:04.969 --> 00:00:07.998
<v Posy>Posy: Florence! Please find the best land for our town.

3
00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:09.709
<v Florence>Florence: Best land? Easy!

4
00:00:09.779 --> 00:00:14.336
<v Florence>Florence: Here! Flat, wide and right by the river. I am 82% sure!

5
00:00:16.006 --> 00:00:18.931
<v Dev>Dev: Hmm. Why is the grass so squelchy?

6
00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:23.230
Flat land looks best to Florence. But what did she miss?

7
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.605
Step into the AI Lab and check.
